meta {
  name: Cari Tutor (Matching Engine)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseURL}}/api/tutors?query=Integral&course_id=course-kalkulus-1&topic=Integral%20Tentu&max_budget=45000
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  query: Integral
  course_id: course-kalkulus-1
  topic: Integral Tentu
  max_budget: 45000
  ~schedule: 
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
  forwardAuthorizationHeader: false
}

docs {
  Menyaring tutor terverifikasi dan menghitung skor kecocokan menggunakan rumus Bab 4.7 Brief: `S = 0.35 * M_topik + 0.30 * M_kepercayaan + 0.20 * M_anggaran + 0.15 * M_jadwal` beserta Rating Bayesian. Semua query filter bersifat opsional.
  
  | Query | Nilai |
  |-------|-------|
  | `query` | Kata kunci nama tutor, departemen, bio, atau subtopik |
  | `course_id` | ID mata kuliah (`course-kalkulus-1` / `course-fisika-dasar-1`) |
  | `topic` | Nama subtopik spesifik |
  | `max_budget` | Batas tarif maksimal per 60 menit dalam Rupiah |
  | `schedule` | Filter hari atau jam slot (contoh: `Senin`, `Sabtu`, `19:00`) |
  
  | Kode | Kapan |
  |------|-------|
  | `200` | Hasil pencarian tutor berhasil diambil |
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Daftar tutor berhasil diambil.",
    "data": [
      {
        "tutor": {
          "id": "tutor-nadia",
          "userId": "user-tutor-1",
          "name": "Nadia Putri",
          "department": "Matematika",
          "cohort": 2023,
          "hourlyRate": 45000,
          "verified": true,
          "badge": "asdos",
          "rating": 4.9,
          "completedSessionsDemo": 24,
          "slots": [
            "Senin 18:30 WIB",
            "Rabu 19:00 WIB",
            "Sabtu 10:00 WIB"
          ]
        },
        "matchScore": 89,
        "matchReasons": [
          "Menguasai Integral Tentu",
          "Verified Asdos",
          "Masuk anggaran",
          "3 slot cocok"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "meta": {
      "count": 3
    }
  }
  ```
}
